      "statement": "AGENTS.md's ADR lifecycle rules: create ADRs as Proposed with Mermaid when flow is relevant, wait for explicit user approval (a feature request does not approve its ADR), use the next unused number (never reuse), mark Accepted after approval, record superseding/superseded relationships, and never leave an implemented decision as Proposed.",
